Kazu looks at the headline again.

A girl disappearing like that.

Her family not knowing where she is.

He thinks about opening YumeChat one day and finding nothing there.

No messages.

No reply.

Yume simply gone from his life.

His stomach tightens.

He doesn't like the thought.

If Yume disappeared from his life, he wouldn't wait around hoping someone else found her.

He'd go looking himself.

Before he can think about it any longer, another notification slides across the top of the screen.

**YumeChat — 1 new message**

He closes the article.

